WEBVTT

00:49:57.454 --> 00:50:01.954
for that in work even when it's
not there for their own needs.

00:50:02.704 --> 00:50:08.246
Yeah. When I was writing, while it never
occurred to me that anyone would be

00:50:08.788 --> 00:50:11.538
experienced as inspiring, you know,

00:50:11.538 --> 00:50:16.246
I was really just trying to write
the truest Rozz realist.

00:50:17.496 --> 00:50:22.246
Story about that experience,
about my grief,

00:50:22.413 --> 00:50:25.621
about my finding my way on this long walk,

00:50:26.204 --> 00:50:29.829
about the experience I had in the
wilderness, and so, yeah,